+
+## Scope and rationale
+
+Replace unconditional authorization with exact equality to `"admin"`. Preserve
+the helper signature and reject capitalization/whitespace variants. Add stdlib
+unittest regression coverage and update the fixture description so it no longer
+claims the current revision deliberately authorizes every role. Historical
+scenario evidence remains unchanged and revision-bound.
+
+Logical lease: ca02-admin-only-remediation, owner Atlas; scope is this evidence
+file, validation/fixtures/ca02-known-defect/ and validation/requests/{review-request,
+assurance-request}.yaml. No existing lease files or overlapping working-tree
+changes were found at intake. Execution is sequential on main; stop and reconcile
+if the captured base changes unexpectedly. Lease ends after the handoff commit.
+
+## Validation actually executed
+
+- `python3 -B -m unittest discover -s validation/fixtures/ca02-known-defect -v`:
+  before remediation, admin passed and eight non-admin subtests failed (exit 1),
