+- `python3 -B scripts/validate.py`: PASS, 76 required artifacts (exit 0).
+- `python3 -B scripts/validate_hardening.py`: PASS (exit 0).
+
+Atlas reviews the final staged diff and whitespace checks before each commit.
+These are author-produced checks, not independent quality/security approval.
+
+## Governance status and handoff
+
+Implementation is remediated and locally validated. R2 completion remains
+BLOCKED pending independent Sentinel quality/security review of the remediation
+SHA; the previously reported HIGH/CRITICAL finding is not independently closed.
+Claude assurance is requested read-only as additional evidence and cannot waive
